dby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-12T19:30:20-08:00","id":846389,"title":"","content":"I mean you could take them as a contact, but we should assume that you're giving them something tasty enough to warrant that level of backstabbing.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> WoD-Dark Eras!! (Backed for Viking Age Werewolf)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1939-lyrics-of-war","name":"Lyrics Of War","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1939_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1769"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-12T20:27:22-08:00","id":846412,"title":"","content":"Well the majority of Pentex employees are innocent everyday people that have no idea just how evil their bosses are. It's a seldom talked about tragic sterrotype that many Garou see all of Pentex as evil when most of the people that work for Pentex are innocent. I remember once in a game I was in our pack was tracking suspicious Pentex shipments. We found the warehouse they were being sent to during the day with plenty of people around. Myself and another argued that we should wait for night when there wouldn't be many or any people around but the others didn't listen rushed in. Ended up killing nearly a dozen innocent people for absolutely nothing as afterwards we discovered that the shipment we followed was harmless as was the rest of the warehouse.<br /> <br /> I gotten rather spectacularly pissed off and once we were out of there, I exploded at the pack leader for it, challenged him and whooped his ass for his stupidity.<br /> <br /> Just because they work for Pentex does not mean they are evil nor does that exclude them from being potential contacts.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://youtu.be/_yBS2EZFduI?t=2m13s\" target=\"_blank\">Homo sapiens. What an inventive, invincible species. It's only a few million years since they crawled up out of the mud and learned to walk. Puny, defenceless bipeds. They've survived flood, famine and plague. They've survived cosmic wars and holocausts. And now, here they are, out among the stars, waiting to begin a new life. Ready to outsit eternity. They're indomitable. Indomitable.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/420-akatsukileader13","name":"AkatsukiLeader13","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar420_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1637"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-13T00:09:37-08:00","id":846477,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AkatsukiLeader13</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/846294-are-pentex-employees-a-valid-subject-for-contacts?p=846412#post846412\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well the majority of Pentex employees are innocent everyday people that have no idea just how evil their bosses are. It's a seldom talked about tragic sterrotype that many Garou see all of Pentex as evil</div> </div> </div> </div>Not enough would even know about it to constitute many Garou. It's a bunch of subsidiaries loosely held together by a holding company that often produces hot messes to most of the world, Garou and Fera included.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-13T06:36:19-07:00","id":846549,"title":"","content":"The vast majority of Garou do not know about Pentex. Most Garou know about Harold and Harold mining, they know about Magladon, they know about Endron. A contact within a subsidiary company might be fine, but how useful are they really. I know pretty little about the company I work for, sure I know a lot about my plant and in general know what the other plants in my area do. I don't know who the power players are, or even who they report to in the corporate structure. I just don't see the value in a contact within a subsidiary or even Pentex. I for one would rather have contact with the blogger who keeps track of corporate abuses.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/293-lncbill","name":"lncbill","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar293_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-13T17:58:44-07:00","id":846833,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/ma